      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{58c6cbcffd04b1785f747b6c|full_name}: Hi. No, it does not play, again only with keeping the last frame. Maybe, I think that the VRC_SyncVideoStream needs to reconnect to the Youtube Live server, at lease with receiving a play event, because I feel it very heavy load to continue to check state of the Youtube live. If it is light load, I hope the continuous check for about 10 sec intervals. Thank you.",
