      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I put VRC_syncvideostream in my world.\nI'd like to report current behavior and request for improve on youtube live streaming.\n\nBehaviors:\nWhile YT live streaming : \nNewly join to the world, play automatically. it's perfect.\n\nWaiting for YT live streaming start:\nVRC_syncvideostream shows white screen. even if stream starts on youtube, VRC_syncvideostream not start automatically.\nIf possible, please show thumbnails from youtube page and start automatically when stream starts.\n\nAfter YT live streaming end:\nVRC_syncvideostream shows white screen again.\n\nThanks in advance.\nDJ SHARPNEL",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
