  "details": "Thank you for support the VRC_SyncVideoStream. So, by the current spec of the VRC_SyncVideoStream, we can only watch a youtube live that have already begin in on air.\nHowever, It is very inconvenient, because we can not wait for starting a youtube live in the world where VRC_SyncVideoStream object is put. If the current spec have any solution, I would like to know it. Or I hope to fix the Inconvenience. I post it to the two threads, because I don’t know whether it is a bug. Thank you.",
